The checkpoint baseline retains concurrent documentation additions and uses repository LF line endings for the server JSON. Other task-start source and binary snapshots remain exact. This excludes other agents' Daily, Rivalry and loading-review notes from the patch.

Owner appearance/touch acceptance, phone performance and matching online catalogue rollout remain. New display copy continues the existing forklift English fallback. No device query/test, APK, real purchase, owner-save change, owner-process restart, live sync mutation or deployment was performed. Concurrent work is preserved.
